{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-04679-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":1,"evidence":["8번 환자)은 지난 12일 퇴원했다","\"신천지 신도가 아니다\"고 부인했다","동선 공개로 아파하실 그분들에게 따사로운 살핌을 바란다"],"reason":"The summary scrambles the patient facts. It says 113번 and 231번 were discharged, but the source says the 8번 patient was discharged. It also says 113번 was a Shincheonji member who 'denied' it to authorities, which reverses the source. It dates the Facebook post to the 23rd when it was the 22nd, and it says '당부했다' about the wish to eat at the restaurants. The sentences are garbled."},"B":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["정작 제가 마녀사냥을 하고 있었던 사람이었다","오후 4시 현재 1000명 이상이 이 글에 공감을 눌렀고","접촉자로 관리하는 사람은 총 40명"],"reason":"The facts it includes are mostly accurate: the briefing, the self-reproach, the reaction counts, the 2 new cases and the 40 contacts. It omits the context that the post was about disclosing patients' movements and the harm to businesses, and the self-reproach is vague. Its closing sentence runs the new cases and the contact count together awkwardly."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["강 과장은 \"검사량이 늘어나 몸이 피곤한 건 괜찮다\"","확진자의 구체적인 동선 공개는 ... 불가피한 조치라는 시각이 우세하다","\"저 자신이 가소롭고 가증스럽습니다.\""],"reason":"It omits the central point, which is the official's self-criticism for witch-hunting. It also credits the 'unavoidable measure' view to 강 과장. The source presents that as the prevailing view, in contrast to his own reluctance."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["전파 가능성을 최소화하기 위해서이지 식당과 업체를 두 번 죽이자는 의도가 아니다","'마녀사냥이 참 쉽다'고 했는데 정작 제가 마녀사냥을 하고 있었던 사람이었다"],"reason":"It says disclosure is 'not for minimizing transmission', which reverses the source. It also presents 'witch-hunts are easy' as a briefing remark and drops the self-reproach. The reaction counts and the 2 cases are accurate, but '접촉자 관리 총 40명' is awkward."}}}
